forceTaskPrompt.en-US:
[Forced squash | attempt {attempt}] Context reached {tokens}, exceeding the forced threshold {threshold}. Stop the original task immediately. Until squash succeeds, do not continue implementation, explain, or call any other tools.

You may only:
1. Call session_log and choose a completed starting point that frees enough context;
2. Generate a precise summary from the full current context;
3. Call session_squash once with both from and the complete summary.

The summary must preserve the exact in-progress stopping point, user goals and constraints, completed and unfinished work, key decisions, errors and risks, file/branch/commit state, and next steps. Use these sections: ## Goal, ## Constraints & Preferences, ## Progress (Done / In Progress / Blocked), ## Key Decisions, ## Next Steps, and ## Critical Context. Squash now even if the task is unfinished. Do not merely reply with text; complete the session_squash call.
